{"suttaId":"sn22.126","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[786,789],"vripara":"126"},"segments":{"sn22.126:0.3":"Samudayadhammasuttaṃ","sn22.126:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn22.126:1.2":"Atha kho aññataro bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā … pe … ekamantaṃ nisinno kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","sn22.126:1.3":"“‘avijjā avijjā’ti, bhante, vuccati.","sn22.126:1.4":"Katamā nu kho, bhante, avijjā, kittāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti?","sn22.126:2.1":"“Idha, bhikkhu, assutavā puthujjano samudayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.2":"vayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘vayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.3":"samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.126:2.4":"Samudayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘samudayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.5":"vayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘vayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.6":"samudayavayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.126:2.7":"Samudayadhammaṃ saññaṃ … pe … samudayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘samudayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.9":"vayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘vayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.10":"samudayavayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘samudayavayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.126:2.11":"Samudayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘samudayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.12":"vayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘vayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti;","sn22.126:2.13":"samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.126:2.14":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhu, avijjā;","sn22.126:2.15":"ettāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti.","sn22.126:3.1":"Evaṃ vutte, so bhikkhu bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","sn22.126:3.2":"“‘vijjā vijjā’ti, bhante, vuccati.","sn22.126:3.3":"Katamā nu kho, bhante, vijjā, kittāvatā ca vijjāgato hotī”ti?","sn22.126:4.1":"“Idha, bhikkhu, sutavā ariyasāvako samudayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.2":"vayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘vayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.3":"samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ rūpan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.126:4.4":"Samudayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘samudayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.5":"vayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘vayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.6":"samudayavayadhammaṃ vedanaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammā vedanā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.126:4.7":"Samudayadhammaṃ saññaṃ … samudayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘samudayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.9":"vayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘vayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.10":"samudayavayadhamme saṅkhāre ‘samudayavayadhammā saṅkhārā’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.126:4.11":"Samudayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘samudayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.12":"vayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘vayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti;","sn22.126:4.13":"samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇaṃ ‘samudayavayadhammaṃ viññāṇan’ti yathābhūtaṃ pajānāti.","sn22.126:4.14":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhu, vijjā;","sn22.126:4.15":"ettāvatā ca vijjāgato hotī”ti.","sn22.126:4.16":"Paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":387,"to":390,"paras":[{"para":387,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.126:1"],"lines":["126-135. Avijjāvaggo uttānatthova.","Imasmiñhi vagge sabbasuttesu catusaccameva kathitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.126:1"],["sn22.126:1"]]},{"para":388,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Avijjāvaggo terasamo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":389,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":390,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.126:1"],"lines":["1-13. Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.126:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":390,"to":394,"paras":[{"para":390,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.126:1"],"lines":["126-135. <b>Imasmin</b>ti avijjāvagge.","<b>Catusaccameva kathitaṃ, tasmā</b> heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānamevāti adhippāyo."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.126:1"],["sn22.126:1"]]},{"para":391,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samudayadhammasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Avijjāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":394,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.126:1"],"lines":["1-14. Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.126:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
